body:
@Calinou I tested your demo with this implementation. There are some serious color issues that I think are just caused by the multiple lights, not related to the decals.

I think there is also a problem with the textures in the atlas bleeding into each other due to filtering. At the moment I'm using the existing texture atlas also used for 2D rendering. I'm thinking about creating a separate decal atlas as to not upset the existing implementation if we change things.

Other than that, I think things are working well.
